<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %> - StellarSentry</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-900 text-white min-h-screen">
    <nav class="bg-gray-800 border-b border-gray-700">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex justify-between h-16">
                <div class="flex items-center">
                    <a href="/" class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-400">StellarSentry</a>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                    <a href="/features" class="text-purple-400 font-semibold">Features</a>
                    <a href="/pricing" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white">Pricing</a>
                    <a href="/docs" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white">Docs</a>
                    <a href="/support" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white">Support</a>
                    <a href="/auth/login" class="bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg">Login</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Features</h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Everything you need to manage and grow your Discord community.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-purple-500 transition-colors">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🛡️</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Moderation</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400">Warn, ban, timeout, kick, and manage users with detailed audit logs.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-purple-500 transition-colors">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🎵</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Music</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400">High-quality playback, queues, playlists, and Lavalink support.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-purple-500 transition-colors">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-4">👋</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Welcome & Leave</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400">Custom welcome/leave messages with embeds and auto-roles.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-purple-500 transition-colors">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-4">📈</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Leveling</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400">XP system, role rewards, leaderboards, and custom messages.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-purple-500 transition-colors">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-4">💰</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Economy</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400">Currency, shop, jobs, gambling, and leaderboards.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-purple-500 transition-colors">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🎫</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Tickets</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400">Support ticket system with categories, transcripts, and claims.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-purple-500 transition-colors">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🎉</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Giveaways</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400">Create giveaways with requirements, multiple winners, and rerolls.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-purple-500 transition-colors">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-4">💡</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Suggestions</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400">Community suggestion system with voting and status tracking.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-purple-500 transition-colors">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-4">⭐</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Starboard</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400">Highlight popular messages with star reactions.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="bg-gray-800 border-t border-gray-700 py-8">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 text-center text-gray-500">
            <p>StellarSentry - Discord Bot with Dashboard</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>